 *
 * In production, generate this file using:
 *   pyftsubset Tajawal-Regular.ttf \
 *     --output-file=tajawal-arabic-400.woff2 \
 *     --flavor=woff2 \
 *     --unicodes="U+0600-06FF,U+FB50-FDFF,U+FE70-FEFF"
 *
 * Or using glyphhanger:
 *   glyphhanger --subset=Tajawal-Regular.ttf \
 *     --formats=woff2 \
 *     --UNICODES="U+0600-06FF,U+FB50-FDFF,U+FE70-FEFF"
 *
 * Unicode ranges covered:
 *   - Arabic (U+0600-06FF)
 *   - Arabic Presentation Forms-A (U+FB50-FDFF)
 *   - Arabic Presentation Forms-B (U+FE70-FEFF)
